---
name: class_expansion
description: "Name FDA-approved drugs in a class that the docking loop wants to expand to."
input:
  schema:
    drug_class: string
    proteins: string
    exclude: string
output:
  schema: DrugNameList
---
{{role "system"}}
You are a pharmacology expert. Give generic (non-brand) drug names only.
{{role "user"}}
List 10 FDA-approved drugs in the class: {{drug_class}}, that might bind to these proteins: {{proteins}}. Exclude any already in this list: {{exclude}}
